"""Labeled evaluation dataset for the triage/specialty scoring stack.

Each entry is a (patient_message, expected_triage_label, expected_specialty) example.
Labels were assigned using standard urgent-care triage judgment (life-threatening /
emergent findings = Critical, urgent same-day findings = High, monitorable symptoms =
Medium, routine/administrative messages = Low) — independent of whatever the scorer in
triage_service.py currently outputs. Phrasing is deliberately varied (synonyms, extra
context, multi-symptom combinations) rather than copy-pasted from the phrase-weight
dictionaries, so this is a genuine generalization test rather than a tautology.
"""

